  Text: "The results are in! \nNothing new from the car, whatever halved and flew
    it up here was very clean, only a slight green descoloration was left where the
    thing parted with its missing half, but the lab gave us nothing about that. 
    \n \nAbout the woman... \nThis is a tricky one, she was not just any lady, she
    was the  <link>President of Wankchester, Deandra Monfay</link>!\nWe had the President.
    \nWe had the President on the roof. "
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
